  "description": "Finally, Go Eun-Woo has been appointed as the first health teacher. His job satisfaction is 100%. Stable, sweet vacation, relatively punctual work hours. 'A neat and handsome health teacher with a sad look.' All the fellow teachers and students look favorably on Eun-Woo. Oh, just one person. Except for the ethics teacher Im Seok-Ju who seems to have come from the Joseon Dynasty.\n\n *\"What did you teach in sex education? Why are you handing out these things (condoms)?\"\n\n\"Haven't you ever thought that you'd get complaints from the school administrators?\"\n\n\"Sexual intercourse. It's a noble act that a man and a woman unite to conceive a life when they truly love each other after marriage.\"*\n\nIm Seok-Ju, who advocates premarital chastity, and Go Eun-Woo, who pursues MAX sexual desire and free sexual relations, were fundamentally mismatched from start to finish. Of course, that was until he saw Im Seok-Ju masturbating in the bathroom.\n\n *\"Teacher, should I help you?\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
